    "b-30-integration-resolver-runs-body-9": {
      "id": "b-30-integration-resolver-runs-body-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Launched by the run scheduler loop promptly whenever conflict outcomes exist — resolvers run alongside live workers rather than waiting for an idle pool. Up to "
        },
        {
          "insert": "integrationResolverConcurrency",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " resolver agents (game configuration) run concurrently with path-disjoint locking, so only non-overlapping conflict items run together; no resolver launches while an epoch boundary is running, and the epoch boundary waits for every open resolver before it proceeds."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
